        <UserObject label="&lt;div&gt;Recomender System&lt;/div&gt;" tooltip="Content-Based Filtering Content-based filtering (CBF) is a recommendation strategy that&#xa;suggests items to a user based on the attributes of the items and a profile of the user’s preferences,&#xa;typically utilizing similarity measures to match user preferences with item attributes [83]. In CBF,&#xa;the recommendation ˆrui is based on the features of items ϕ(i) and a profile of the user’s preferences&#xa;θ(u):" id="gTTxGs-TXJTYOzbL5BLj-2">
